# ---- Nextflow runtime / logs ------------------------------------------------
# (unanchored on purpose: also covers m0probe/.nextflow and its logs)
.nextflow/
.nextflow.log*
/work/
/.nf-nextflow/

# ---- Generated pipeline outputs (recreated by every run) --------------------
# Two roots, anchored so nested paths such as m0probe/data/ are NOT ignored:
#   data/     inputs   -- raw reads, reference databases, caches
#   results/  outputs  -- QC, derived data, models, reports
/data/
/results/
/logs/
/benchmarks/

# ---- Local sandbox caches ---------------------------------------------------
.nxhome/
.conda-pkgs/

# ---- m0probe runtime artifacts (its sources ARE tracked) --------------------
m0probe/work/
m0probe/conda-cache/
m0probe/published/

# ---- CI runtime artifacts (tests/ci sources and fixtures ARE tracked) -------
# Every output dir, the work cache and the log/benchmark dirs of a CI run are
# redirected here by tests/ci/ci.config so no check can touch validated data.
tests/ci/out/

# ---- Never committed --------------------------------------------------------
# SKILL.md is an internal competency map written for AI agents working on this
# repo. It is deliberately not part of the published project.
/SKILL.md

# ---- Tooling / OS noise -----------------------------------------------------
# macOS Spotlight: an empty marker file that stops mds from indexing this tree.
# `work/` churns ~150k files per run; without this, every run leaves the indexer
# with a backlog that pins the machine for a long time (measured 2026-10-22:
# load 34 on 8 cores, engine poll interval 5 s -> 296 s, single-threaded steps
# ~20x slower). Reversible: delete the file.
.metadata_never_index
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.DS_Store
report-*.html
trace-*.txt
timeline-*.html
dag-*.html
